        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-07T23:44:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it is particularly useful to specify vid/pid if serial number is given, sn should be used on its own.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 88,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 93,
